# Requirements

> Fuente: https://laravelmodules.com/docs/1/getting-started/requirements
> Exportado: 2026-07-23 20:01 UTC

The menu package requires **PHP 5.5** or higher. The Laravel package also requires **Laravel 5.1** or higher.
